@startuml
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.6
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
|Administration Employee|
start
:Open delivered orders overview;
|System|
if (Delivered, uninvoiced orders?) then ([yes])
  :Show orders per customer\nwith amount and delivery date;
  |Administration Employee|
  :Select order;
  |System|
  :Show delivered order lines\nand extra costs;
  stop
else ([no])
  :Show message no orders;
  stop
endif
@enduml
